/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (On\040Minimizing\040the\040Number\040of\040Multiplications\040Necessary\040for\040Matrix\040Multiplication)
/Author (John\040E\056\040Hopcroft\054\040Leslie\040R\040Kerr)
/Subject (This\040paper\040develops\040an\040algorithm\040to\040multiply\040a\040px2\040matrix\040by\040a\0402xn\040matrix\040in\040\044\134lceil\040\0503pn\053max\050n\054p\051\051\0572\040\134rceil\044\040multiplications\040for\040matrix\040multiplication\040without\040commutativity\040The\040algorithm\040minimizes\040the\040number\040of\040multiplications\040for\040matrix\040multiplication\040without\040commutativity\040for\040the\040special\040cases\040p\0751\040or\0402\054\040n\0751\0542\054\040\044\134cdots\044\040and\040p\040\075\0403\054\040n\040\075\0403\040It\040is\040shown\040that\040with\040commutativity\040fewer\040multiplications\040are\040required)
/Keywords (01\040Sep\0401969\054\040Siam\040Journal\040on\040Applied\040Mathematics\054\040Matrix\040chain\040multiplication\054\040Matrix\040multiplication\054\040Matrix\040\050mathematics\051)
>>
